\@writefile{lot}{\contentsline {table}{\numberline {3}{\ignorespaces Main transfer results: methods $\times $ five public speech QA benchmarks (TriviaQA/WebQ/Llama Q.\ judged by OAB official, $n$ = 250; SD-QA/Reasoning zh reference-anchored, $n$ = 200/202). Top: live deployed loop, heard accuracy in \% ($\pm $2--3 point replication floor). Middle: gold-inject view at a matched 30\% budget (Appendix\nobreakspace  {}\ref  {app:fixedthr}). Bottom: the second duplex family, NemotronLabs-VoiceChat-11B --- same frozen recipe, offline re-mix with measured \textsc  {gpt-5.5} outcomes, official judges (Appendix\nobreakspace  {}\ref  {app:nvda}); the English-only model has no zh pool, so its avg spans four benchmarks and $\Delta $ is over its own local floor. $\Delta $ = average gain over always-local (points). AlpacaEval (VoiceBench 1--5, scale-incompatible) is reported in the text: 3.99$\to $4.35 gated, 4.76 measured always-escalate, no gain over random on MiniCPM; the second family does gain (3.55$\to $4.46 vs.\ random 4.23).}}{9}{table.3}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{tab:transfer}{{3}{9}{Main transfer results: methods $\times $ five public speech QA benchmarks (TriviaQA/WebQ/Llama Q.\ judged by OAB official, $n$ = 250; SD-QA/Reasoning zh reference-anchored, $n$ = 200/202). Top: live deployed loop, heard accuracy in \% ($\pm $2--3 point replication floor). Middle: gold-inject view at a matched 30\% budget (Appendix~\ref {app:fixedthr}). Bottom: the second duplex family, NemotronLabs-VoiceChat-11B --- same frozen recipe, offline re-mix with measured \textsc {gpt-5.5} outcomes, official judges (Appendix~\ref {app:nvda}); the English-only model has no zh pool, so its avg spans four benchmarks and $\Delta $ is over its own local floor. $\Delta $ = average gain over always-local (points). AlpacaEval (VoiceBench 1--5, scale-incompatible) is reported in the text: 3.99$\to $4.35 gated, 4.76 measured always-escalate, no gain over random on MiniCPM; the second family does gain (3.55$\to $4.46 vs.\ random 4.23)}{table.3}{}}
